WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.930
December 24th

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:06.980
When will Chika get here?
Did she say anything?

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:08.360
Not much.

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:10.440
She hasn't been here before, has she?

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:13.240
I wonder if she can find the
right train and streets?

00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:17.160
Hey, aren't you worried?

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:20.040
It was her who decided to come.

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:22.830
She'll call if she needs help.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:26.130
Hello!

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:29.840
Sorry for making you get food.

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:32.720
Oh c'mon. You have to stay here.

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:34.880
Sorry for taking so long.

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:37.850
Actually, she hasn't arrived yet.

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:40.180
Why don't you call her?

00:00:40.430 --> 00:00:42.220
She'll be all right.

00:00:43.930 --> 00:00:45.140
Big Sister

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:48.150
Siiiis...

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:51.780
Huh?

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:53.740
Could she be...

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:57.820
Could she be Chika?

00:00:59.530 --> 00:01:00.990
You are Chika, right?

00:01:00.990 --> 00:01:05.540
Sorry about this. I wanted to check to
see if this was the right place.

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:09.000
Hello everyone. I'm Chika.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:11.250
Excuse me for coming in this way.

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:14.970
Oh, I forgot to tell you.
I'm Sae's younger sister.

00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:17.970
Stop joking around and enter
through the front door.

00:01:28.690 --> 00:01:34.030
Ano ano donna iro ga ima desuka?

00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:35.280
Egao no white

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:36.740
Namida no blue

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:39.360
Kasanete mita toki

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:44.700
Honjitsu seiten nari canvas ni

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:47.410
Milk no ice, ramune gokun

00:01:47.410 --> 00:01:50.080
Genki ni color topping

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:54.130
Oi! ough gaki please

00:01:54.130 --> 00:02:00.050
Minna no nigaoe contest

00:02:00.390 --> 00:02:02.810
Yuno

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:07.270
Yoshi! Ato de ''pun'' okoranai de ne

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:06.060
Miyako

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:08.560
Hiro

00:02:07.270 --> 00:02:14.400
Switch osaretara wa-ha-ha

00:02:09.060 --> 00:02:11.770
Sae

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:20.740
Nanka ii kimochi nareba ii kanji

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:22.280
Kyousou da

00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:25.080
Ichihayaku ringo tabeyo

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:27.660
Sou ja nainda yo

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:31.330
Sou de iinda yo

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:36.300
Kudamono wa model san

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:41.090
Saa dessin shimasho ka

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:43.970
Shukudai dayo

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:48.850
Figures...

00:02:48.850 --> 00:02:51.940
Your pIace is pretty cluttered.

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:53.770
Plus, it's not very cute.

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:55.980
Yeah, like I care, huh?!

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:58.610
I don't like childish stuff.

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:01.950
That's why you don't have a boyfriend.

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:03.990
You're supposed to be studying
for the entrance exam!

00:03:03.990 --> 00:03:07.490
That's none of your business.

00:03:07.490 --> 00:03:10.500
Now, now, I'll make some tea, okay?

00:03:11.170 --> 00:03:13.380
Chika is a cute name.

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:15.880
Thank you. You must be Yuno.

00:03:16.170 --> 00:03:17.300
Yes.

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:18.510
Then, you're Miyako.

00:03:18.510 --> 00:03:21.550
Ding-dong. So you have a boyfriend?

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:25.010
No, he's just my crush.

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:28.850
A kabuki actor? That's classy.

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:34.230
My room is 201 , and Miya's is 202.

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:40.150
So, everyone's living alone?

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:42.360
It's a Christmas tree.

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:43.990
Wait a sec.

00:03:44.530 --> 00:03:47.830
What's it like living alone? Is it hard?

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:51.910
In the beginning, yes, but I'm used to it now.

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:54.880
I had to do everything myself,

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:59.500
and realized how much I had
depended on my parents.

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:01.840
Huh?

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:04.640
Nothing, I think it's great.

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:08.930
There isn't anything interesting to look at,
but if you want, go ahead.

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:12.640
Cool! I like this kind of room.

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:17.520
That hammock and crafting tools
really suit an art student.

00:04:17.810 --> 00:04:20.230
Do you also cook your own meals, Miyako?

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:24.070
I don't do it often.

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:27.320
I recommend dried food because
it doesn't run as fast.

00:04:27.320 --> 00:04:29.240
Run as fast?

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:32.960
Amazing.

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:37.750
I make this at home, too.
Sis isn't good at it anyway.

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:40.920
Like who cares what kind of shape
an okonomiyaki ends up as?

00:04:41.090 --> 00:04:42.590
Do you like cooking?

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:45.760
Yeah, I want to live alone as soon as possible.

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:49.680
It's not so easy to live alone.

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:52.770
You have to get up in the morning on your own.

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:58.270
But you wake me up every so often.

00:04:58.270 --> 00:05:00.940
I'm a slow-waker, so you're helping me a lot.

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:02.610
Well, umm...

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:05.400
Wow, the bonito flakes are dancing.

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:09.370
The school is so close.

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:11.910
Yeah, it's like fifteen seconds by foot.

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:13.580
Are you done?

00:05:13.950 --> 00:05:14.960
Chika!

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:19.170
Hey, stop! It's a holiday, so you can't go in.

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:21.380
Just for a second. I want to look around.

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:24.970
So, this is your class room?

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:28.340
Looks rather ordinary.

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:31.260
Might as well, because we
take general classes too.

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:35.730
Hey, you've looked at the places
you wanted to, so let's go.

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:37.600
Oh, dear.

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:40.020
Do you like art?

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:43.940
Not really. I'm not good at drawing.

00:05:44.650 --> 00:05:48.360
I like music more.
And also home economics.

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:53.660
Hi, guys, what's up?

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:55.620
Is she...

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:58.620
Sorry, she's my sister, Chika.

00:05:58.620 --> 00:06:01.630
She insisted on checking out the school.

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:04.630
I see. What year is she in?

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:05.840
Third year of Junior High.

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:05.550
Year 3

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:11.550
So, you'll be taking an entrance exam soon.
Is she interested in Yamabuki High?

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:14.430
No, not at all. We're leaving now.

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:19.850
That's a shame. I could show her my
costumes for my sketching class.

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:22.690
We have to go shopping next.

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:27.070
I see. All right, have a nice Christmas.

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:28.700
Material Room

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:32.870
There's something weird over there.

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:35.410
What is he? A Martian?

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:37.330
It's the school principal.

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:42.710
That's funny.
Hey, we're leaving.

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:44.920
That was fun.

00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:46.590
Berry Mart was crowded.

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:48.220
Wow!

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:50.260
There goes Santa!

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:57.390
Principal!

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:03.940
Mr. Santa, there are five kids who are
longing for a gift over here!

00:07:03.940 --> 00:07:06.440
Five kids!

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:10.110
Thank you.

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:11.780
Can I take one, too?

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:13.410
Yes!

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:15.240
Hello!

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:17.790
Merry Christmas!

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:23.420
I'm delivering love and joy to everyone.

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:25.340
Ms. Yoshinoya...

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:27.130
Is that the teacher from earlier?

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:28.050
Here's your cake.

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:30.970
Thank you very much.

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:32.800
Please, come in.

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:35.050
What a gorgeous meal!

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:37.470
There're enough cakes that you can
eat as much as you want tonight.

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:38.810
Please help yourself.

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:41.440
Thank you. I'll have some, then.

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:44.440
Where did you get your costume?

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:47.650
I made it myself. Do you like it?

00:07:47.650 --> 00:07:50.400
Yes, you are awesome. Bravo!

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:52.110
Chika!

00:07:52.110 --> 00:07:55.030
Thank you. I'm so happy.

00:07:55.030 --> 00:08:00.620
You didn't say anything about
your cute little sister.

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:03.000
Well, ummm, she's not that cute.

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:04.620
Sis, you're mean.

00:08:04.620 --> 00:08:07.630
Now, now, sisters should get along.

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:13.010
Well, I want to stay, but I have to go
to the next stop, so I'm going.

00:08:13.010 --> 00:08:15.090
Huh? Are you leaving already?

00:08:15.300 --> 00:08:18.350
Yes, the Santa Girl is busy.

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:21.980
I'm taking off.

00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:23.730
I'm so full.

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:25.730
Are you all leaving?

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:28.480
You haven't seen each other
for a while, have you?

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:30.860
We'd better let you spend time together.

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:33.450
You're being too nice.

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:35.490
Goodnight.

00:08:35.490 --> 00:08:36.740
Goodnight.

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:38.200
See you tomorrow.

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:40.330
Okay, goodnight.

00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:42.330
Goodnight.

00:08:45.870 --> 00:08:47.540
Miya?

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:51.670
Sorry, but I can stay at your place?

00:08:53.880 --> 00:09:01.220
So many times, I e-mailed, faxed and
mailed about today's visit,

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:03.680
but Sis didn't even reply.

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:06.310
It must be because Sae is shy.

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:09.770
She doesn't talk much about her family.

00:09:11.070 --> 00:09:13.940
Maybe she wants you to be only hers.

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:18.740
You know the tendency of being mean
to someone you like?

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:23.200
It's impossible.
If so, she could be a little nicer.

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:26.960
She's not exactly straightforward so...

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:29.790
Should I talk to her?

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:32.800
No! We should leave her alone.

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:34.090
But...

00:09:34.090 --> 00:09:36.800
Okay, let's throw a huge party here.

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:40.220
Sae might become curious and visit here.

00:09:41.220 --> 00:09:42.850
A luring operation...

00:09:44.470 --> 00:09:45.600
There!

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:47.770
That's mean.

00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:49.270
There she comes.

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:50.940
Come in!

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:52.440
Hey, Chika!

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:53.980
Don't start yelling...

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:58.360
Sorry, she says she's lonely
if Chika isn't around.

00:09:58.360 --> 00:09:59.490
What? Why did you...

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:01.950
Let's play Daihinmin.

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:02.990
What?

00:10:02.990 --> 00:10:05.450
It's not quite as exciting with only three players.
What?

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:08.540
Please, come in.

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:08.580
Hi

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:08.580
Da

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:08.580
Ma

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:08.580
Ri

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:08.580
Sketch

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:09.620
I'm done.

00:10:09.620 --> 00:10:10.540
Me, too.

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:12.460
Wait...
Me, too.

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:14.630
You are still the poor one?

00:10:14.630 --> 00:10:16.130
Shut up.

00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:20.140
Sorry, I didn't mean for this to happen.

00:10:20.140 --> 00:10:23.100
So, how did you get into an argument?

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:24.560
Well, you know...

00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:26.640
Because Sis is stingy.

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:28.140
She didn't let you use a futon?

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:29.770
That's not it!

00:10:31.100 --> 00:10:34.440
Keep your nose out, Sis.

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:36.190
Chika, I'm fine with it, okay?

00:10:36.190 --> 00:10:37.940
What do you mean by keeping her nose out?

00:10:38.150 --> 00:10:41.620
I only said I wanted her autograph.

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:44.990
I want to show off to my friends.

00:10:44.990 --> 00:10:48.410
You'll be happy if I do, right?
I said, I would.

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:53.590
I don't need it any more. When you
refused earlier, I got bored.

00:10:53.590 --> 00:10:55.500
You little...

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:58.470
I suggest that you give her your autograph.

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:02.800
Isn't it nice to have a sibling? I'm...

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:06.510
Yunocchi is dozing off, so is Chika.

00:11:06.510 --> 00:11:08.140
I'm not asleep.

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:10.850
Don't you have to get up early tomorrow?

00:11:10.850 --> 00:11:14.150
Don't be so stubborn; just go to bed.

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:15.940
Where are you going, Chika?

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:20.360
I'm going to see my old friend
who moved to this city.

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:23.450
Sounds good. You can't wait, can you?

00:11:24.780 --> 00:11:26.700
The End

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:29.580
<i>December 25th: Goodbye Ume-Sensei</i>

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:53.100
Oh no! I overslept.

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:55.110
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:12:03.490 --> 00:12:05.120
Sae?

00:12:09.830 --> 00:12:11.660
Sorry, did I wake you up?

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:14.830
Oh, that's right. You're going somewhere.

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:17.960
Yeah, my friend and I made a promise to meet.

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:21.420
How long will it take from here to Maihama?

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:24.970
Ummm...

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:28.350
It's all right. I'll find out myself.

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:31.850
Right! All set!

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:37.940
Thanks for all your help.
Sorry to bother you. I'll e-mail you.

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:39.570
Okay.

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:42.070
Sis, I'm leaving my pajamas.

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:45.910
I enjoyed it a lot. Thanks.

00:12:46.320 --> 00:12:47.950
Right!

00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:51.870
She's gone.

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:56.620
Making a big fuss so early in the morning.
She wears me out.

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:05.180
We played Daihinmin way too late.

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:09.260
It's so quiet. I can't believe
we sat up late playing.

00:13:09.640 --> 00:13:12.560
I hadn't played Daihinmin for a long time.

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:17.190
Everyone's going home tomorrow right?
What's your plan for today?

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:20.320
The word "plan" is not in my dictionary.

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:21.570
What about you, Sae?

00:13:21.570 --> 00:13:24.780
Nothing, really. What about you, Yuno?

00:13:25.110 --> 00:13:29.030
I wanted to go to the art store
to restock my supplies.

00:13:29.450 --> 00:13:33.620
We can go together later.
Why don't we finish cleaning first?

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:40.670
You'll go home tomorrow, right?
Why aren't you going home with Chika?

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:45.670
I have my deadline, so I'll stay
here as long as I can.

00:13:46.050 --> 00:13:48.680
I see, I hope you can focus.

00:13:50.180 --> 00:13:52.600
So, we don't see each other until next year.

00:13:53.850 --> 00:13:57.140
I'll be away from Yamabuki High
for a brief while.

00:13:59.350 --> 00:14:00.690
Hi, ladies.

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:02.980
Hello, Principal.

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:07.780
Hello, Merry Christmas to you.

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:11.240
Right! Merry Christmas to you too.

00:14:11.450 --> 00:14:15.910
Did you have fun last night?

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:19.960
I'm looking forward to your cheerful smiles
in the next semester.

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:23.000
Well, take care. Have a nice new year.

00:14:25.460 --> 00:14:27.590
No, he'll hear us.

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:29.680
A person who was Santa yesterday...

00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:31.390
...is totally normal today.

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:33.720
It's still daytime, you know?

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:40.940
Once Christmas is over,
the end of the year will come quickly.

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:44.070
A year goes by quickly.

00:14:49.650 --> 00:14:50.990
That's Shinya.

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:52.530
From yesterday's show?

00:14:52.530 --> 00:14:54.740
The bicycle kid...

00:14:54.740 --> 00:14:56.540
It could be a fiction.

00:14:57.120 --> 00:14:59.080
Hi

00:14:57.120 --> 00:14:59.080
Da

00:14:57.120 --> 00:14:59.080
Ma

00:14:57.120 --> 00:14:59.080
Ri

00:14:57.120 --> 00:14:59.080
Sketch

00:14:59.910 --> 00:15:03.790
There they are. A large store is awesome.

00:15:04.460 --> 00:15:06.250
There're so many different kinds of paper.

00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:10.010
Watson, muse cotton, mermaid...

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:12.470
There are so many brushes too.

00:15:12.800 --> 00:15:15.470
Hog bristles, horsehairs,
squirrel hair brushes...

00:15:19.770 --> 00:15:21.480
Is that you, Yuno?

00:15:21.480 --> 00:15:22.600
Oh, Landlord.

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:24.900
Did you come here for a Christmas gift?

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:29.070
No, I need to buy some paper
for my winter assignment.

00:15:29.280 --> 00:15:29.740
Happy New Year

00:15:29.780 --> 00:15:31.820
Is that for your New Year greeting cards?

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:32.280
Welcome Spring

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:32.280
Yes, I'm thinking of making some.

00:15:32.280 --> 00:15:34.280
Yes, I'm thinking of making some.

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:35.910
Starting now?

00:15:35.910 --> 00:15:36.580
What?

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:37.790
It's nothing.
What?

00:15:38.240 --> 00:15:41.710
It'll be all right as long as the cards
are received in January.

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:43.080
Well, good luck.

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:46.670
Oh, why don't you buy paper after
the end of the year?

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:48.710
The New Year sale is 20% off.

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:50.340
Oh, okay.

00:15:49.550 --> 00:15:50.010
20% off

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:54.090
20% off... I'd better wait, then.

00:15:56.850 --> 00:15:59.470
You're this one, a sheep. Baa-aa.

00:15:59.470 --> 00:16:00.770
Is that so?

00:16:00.770 --> 00:16:02.770
I just met the landlord.

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:04.060
Really?

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:06.190
Sae is this one.

00:16:06.190 --> 00:16:08.190
Don't cut across my path!

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:09.780
What are you talking about?

00:16:09.780 --> 00:16:13.740
Don't you know it's a bad sign when
a black cat crosses your path?

00:16:13.740 --> 00:16:15.660
It's just a superstition.

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:17.530
Then, Miyako is this.

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:20.370
Hey, it's supper time.

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:23.460
What would suit Chika best?

00:16:26.830 --> 00:16:27.880
This one?

00:16:27.880 --> 00:16:30.300
A snow dome? Why?

00:16:30.590 --> 00:16:32.840
It's sparkly and cute.

00:16:38.180 --> 00:16:39.810
What?

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:45.350
We always eat together, don't we?

00:16:45.520 --> 00:16:47.900
It's more fun to eat with others.

00:16:48.310 --> 00:16:51.110
I wish I could drag this on until the New Year.

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:53.780
Oh, c'mon. You'll go home tomorrow, right?

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:55.490
Oh, that's right.

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:57.490
We won't be able to see each other for a while.

00:16:57.870 --> 00:17:03.160
You have a deadline, right?
Won't being alone make you lonely?

00:17:03.370 --> 00:17:06.580
Umm, I don't think I'll have time to feel lonely.

00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:08.790
Sounds tough.

00:17:08.960 --> 00:17:12.130
Here, we still have a whole cake.

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:15.220
I'm finally getting tired of cakes.

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:17.930
You know how lucky you are
to be able to say that?

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:21.390
That's the cake Ms. Yoshinoya brought, right?

00:17:23.060 --> 00:17:24.060
Wow!

00:17:24.060 --> 00:17:25.480
It's homemade.

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:27.230
I can't believe she went this far.

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:30.190
There's a card. It says...

00:17:30.860 --> 00:17:37.240
Show me your lively smiles.
Don't forget your homework.

00:17:37.570 --> 00:17:39.320
What a caring teacher.

00:17:39.570 --> 00:17:41.830
I kinda feel bad about eating this up.

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:45.120
Well, let me get a knife and slice the cake...

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:48.960
Well, this will be our last cake.

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:52.090
I'll try to lose weight even
harder when I get home.

00:17:52.340 --> 00:17:55.090
What will you do with all the rice cakes,
or New Year cuisine?

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:58.340
How could you say that?!

00:17:58.890 --> 00:18:05.350
I was worried because I had never
lived away from my parents.

00:18:05.680 --> 00:18:10.730
But it's been great because of you guys.
Thanks for helping me.

00:18:11.110 --> 00:18:12.980
What's the matter all of a sudden?

00:18:12.980 --> 00:18:14.440
I was worried, too.

00:18:14.440 --> 00:18:16.110
I doubt it.

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:21.780
But once I started living alone, I realized I
could take care of myself pretty well.

00:18:21.780 --> 00:18:24.240
Where's your confidence come from?

00:18:24.740 --> 00:18:28.830
I think Miya can survive wherever
she goes more or less.

00:18:29.460 --> 00:18:33.090
I wonder if Chika wanted to live like us?

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:36.630
Oh, forget it. She's still too dependant.

00:18:36.960 --> 00:18:42.050
Even so, when we first came to
the Hidamari Apartments,

00:18:42.050 --> 00:18:47.140
we had to depend on older students,
like Misato.

00:18:50.270 --> 00:18:55.690
I wasn't sure if I could live alone
if I had nobody near me.

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:59.650
Yeah, this place is a little strange.

00:18:59.650 --> 00:19:04.280
You don't feel like you're living alone, do you?

00:19:04.280 --> 00:19:10.160
Same here. I don't think I could
feed myself if I was all alone.

00:19:10.160 --> 00:19:12.500
That's totally different from
what you said earlier.

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:15.960
Chika?

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:17.590
Let me see...

00:19:18.010 --> 00:19:22.140
''Sis, thanks for the Christmas gift.''

00:19:22.550 --> 00:19:24.140
Hey, Sae...

00:19:24.510 --> 00:19:25.890
When did you?

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:27.850
What did you give her?

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:30.850
Well, umm... nothing really...

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:38.990
Sae?

00:19:41.490 --> 00:19:43.780
So, you did give her your autograph.

00:19:44.070 --> 00:19:45.700
Well, kinda.

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:53.370
Good luck with your entrance exam!

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:53.500
Aya Tachibana

00:19:53.370 --> 00:19:55.040
Nice ending.

00:19:55.750 --> 00:20:01.420
I know I shouldn't, but for some reason,
I act distantly.

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:04.220
I wish I had a sibling.

00:20:04.550 --> 00:20:06.180
I'm touched.

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:09.600
I'm an only child so I envy you.

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:13.770
I have an older brother,
so those kind of things don't happen.

00:20:14.230 --> 00:20:16.060
Miyako, mind your manners.

00:20:16.060 --> 00:20:17.860
I've been scolded by a big sister.

00:20:19.570 --> 00:20:22.490
I don't feel like preparing for
my trip home tomorrow.

00:20:22.610 --> 00:20:24.860
I'll eat like a horse during the New Year.

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:26.740
I'll be on a diet.

00:20:26.740 --> 00:20:28.620
Don't eat too many rice cakes.

00:20:28.700 --> 00:20:33.710
I know that. Make sure you don't
doze off and catch a cold.

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:37.420
I'll send you my New Year greeting card.

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:42.880
Well, it's a bit early, but have a nice
year-end. See you next year.

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:45.090
Sure!

00:20:49.260 --> 00:20:51.640
That was a long day.

00:20:53.430 --> 00:20:58.810
Come to think of it, it hasn't even
been a year since I came here.

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:03.070
I already feel at home here.

00:21:09.740 --> 00:21:14.540
I feel lucky to have two homes.

00:21:42.860 --> 00:21:47.450
I wonder if it will snow in January?
I hope it will.

00:22:05.760 --> 00:22:08.760
End of December 25th

00:22:07.130 --> 00:22:08.760
Goodnight...

