Kiete itsuka wa hakanai sora e ue e

00:22:21.400 --> 00:22:23.020
Koe

00:22:23.730 --> 00:22:27.860
Awa ni natte kieru

00:22:28.780 --> 00:22:31.240
Kiweu

00:22:32.280 --> 00:22:35.950
Sorezore no basho e

00:22:37.250 --> 00:22:44.460
Hirameki hishimeki au yuugou shite

00:22:46.340 --> 00:22:49.930
Kono karada wa hitotu de

00:22:49.930 --> 00:22:53.100
Hitotu no you de mugen de

00:22:53.100 --> 00:22:56.520
Koboreochita shizuku wo

00:22:56.520 --> 00:23:02.520
Ima kakagete miteru yo

00:23:03.400 --> 00:23:05.150
Mebae Drive

00:23:05.150 --> 00:23:09.610
Hashire sky hadashi no mama

00:23:09.610 --> 00:23:13.780
Hora me wo tsubutte utsuridashuta

00:23:13.780 --> 00:23:16.950
Niji no hashi e yukou

00:23:16.950 --> 00:23:18.660
Mebae Drive

00:23:18.660 --> 00:23:23.000
Terasu spark kudaketa hoshi

00:23:23.000 --> 00:23:31.220
Sora ni chiribame ochiteku
